## Real-World Applications

* AI can help create websites and simple programs.
* It can be used to write HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
* Unit tests can help check smaller parts of AI-generated code.
* Integration tests can check if changes broke the rest of a program.
* AI can help find and fix errors when given the error message.
* More detailed prompts can help AI create something closer to what the user wants.
* AI can also help make things like SVG graphics or simple games.

The lecture showed that testing and checking the AI's work is still important, especially because AI can make code that works but is inefficient or incorrect.

